      "note": "Verdict unchanged (still claimed by stores/promotion), but the 2026-08-11 review characterised this surface as a catalog DISCOUNT-campaign entity. A live create probe on 2026-08-16 contradicted that: Promotions V3 is a category-page BANNER surface (required media, optional destinationUrl, category placements — no discount, scope, or date fields exist). stores/promotion was corrected accordingly and its capability renamed commerce.promotions -> marketing.storefront-banner. Discount-rule plugin campaigns do NOT belong to this surface."
